"description" = "Secure your accounts with Autheris — a privacy-first two-factor authentication app for iPhone and iPad.\n\nAutheris generates the time-based one-time passwords (TOTP) that protect your most important accounts, and keeps the secrets behind them on your device. No account, no sign-up, no ads.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n• One-Tap Codes — Copy a code with a single tap. The clipboard clears itself after 60 seconds.\n• Pin and Reorder — Pin the codes you use most to the top, and drag the rest into whatever order suits you.\n• Recently Deleted — Delete a code by mistake? It stays on your device for 7 days, ready to restore.\n• QR Scanning — Add an account by scanning a QR code, or choose a screenshot from your photo library.\n• SHA-1, SHA-256 and SHA-512 — Including the services that need more than the default. If a service rejects your codes, the algorithm is editable per account.\n• Import — Bring your accounts across from Google Authenticator, Aegis, andOTP or 2FAS.\n• Search — Find any account instantly, however long your list gets.\n• Issuer Icons — Familiar brand marks so you can spot an account at a glance.\n• Countdown Ring — A clear, color-customizable ring shows how long each code has left.\n\nPRIVACY AND SECURITY\n• Face ID / Touch ID Lock — Locks when opened, and again after 30 seconds in the background.\n• Blurred When Backgrounded — Content blurs when you switch apps, and your codes are hidden in the app switcher.\n• Protected While Recording — Codes are covered whenever your screen is being recorded or mirrored.\n• Secrets Stay on Your Device — Codes and setup keys are kept in the iOS Keychain and never leave your device unless you export them or turn on iCloud Sync.\n• Encrypted Backups — Save an AES-256-GCM encrypted backup protected by a password only you know.\n• Optional iCloud Sync — Off by default. When you enable it, your secrets are end-to-end encrypted by CloudKit, and the developer cannot read them.\n• No Account, No Tracking — Nothing to sign up for, no analytics, no advertising. Autheris is open source.\n\nInstall Autheris, add an account, and keep your second factor under your own control.";
"keywords" = "two-factor,mfa,2-factor,token,generator,security,privacy,private,backup,sync,icloud,vault";
"whatsNew" = "Autheris 2.0 is a big update.\n\nNEW\n• Pin and Reorder — Pin the codes you use most to the top, and drag the rest into any order.\n• Recently Deleted — A deleted code is kept on your device for 7 days, so a wrong tap is recoverable. Restore it, or remove it for good straight away.\n• Protected While Recording — Codes are now covered if your screen is being recorded or mirrored, alongside the existing app-switcher and background protection.\n• SHA-256 and SHA-512 — Choose the algorithm when adding or editing a code. Some services need something other than the default.\n• Account Is Now Optional — Add a code without filling in an account name.\n\nIMPROVED\n• Redesigned home screen, with Add and Edit rebuilt as native forms — the code updates live as you change a setting.\n• Tokens, settings and pending deletions now live in the Keychain, so they survive reinstalling the app.\n• A deleted code can no longer reappear after a reinstall.\n• Fixed a crash a malformed setup link or backup file could trigger.\n• The app is now named Autheris on your home screen, matching the App Store.";
"promotionalText" = "Now with pinning, a 7-day Recently Deleted bin, and SHA-256 support. No account, no tracking — your codes stay on your device.";
"marketingUrl" = "https://eddington.tech/autheris";
"supportUrl" = "https://eddington.tech/autheris";
